OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few bright spells but rather
OL,6,Fcloudy at times through the day with
OL,7,Fpassing showers. Fresh occasionally
OL,8,Fstrong west or southwesterly winds
OL,9,Facross Shetland and Fair Isle.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will see a few
OL,12,Fpassing showers. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be rather cloudy with
OL,14,Fshowers, but these becoming fewer
OL,15,Flater on.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA rather cloudy day with a
OL,18,Ffew passing showers but some spells of
OL,19,Fdry weather too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
