OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers at first on Sunday, otherwise
OL,7,Fbecoming dry. Mainly dry on Monday,
OL,8,Fperhaps a little rain on Tuesday.
